    "text_full": "Receptions\nCHAPELS/VENUES\nPACKAGES\nPRODUCTS\nVIEW A CEREMONY\nCONTACT US\nLogin\nHome\nReceptions\nChapels/Venues\nPackages\nProducts\nView A Wedding\nContact Us\nLogin\nVoted Best Wedding Chapel in Vegas\n  \nVenues\nPackages\nAvailability\nGet Married in Vegas\n\nCelebrate your love at Chapel of the Flowers, the gorgeous, top-rated Las Vegas wedding chapel where legendary wedding, vow renewal and commitment ceremonies have taken place on the world-famous Strip for 65 years.\n\nContact a wedding planner now and let us know what we can do to make your dream wedding a reality. Use our online booking tool to check availability or browse our venues and wedding packages.\n\nVenues Packages Availability\n  \nWedding Venues\nLas Vegas Wedding Chapels\n\nImagine for a moment the perfect Las Vegas wedding venue: elegant and serene, an oasis of bliss that is ideal for your dream ceremony. Your dream is about to come true at Chapel of the Flowers.\n\nThe Glass Gardens\n\n101\n\nLa Capella Chapel\n\n80\n\nThe Gazebo\n\n30\n\nVictorian Chapel\n\n30\n\nMagnolia Chapel\n\n20\n\nMarried In Las Vegas Sign\n\n20\n\nWe've got plenty more venues to check out.\nFind more venues\nWe've got plenty more venues to check out.\nFind more venues\nWedding Packages\nLas Vegas Wedding Packages\n\nChapel of the Flowers has the perfect ceremony package for your wedding, elopement or vow renewal.Every marriage package includes a personal wedding planner and ceremony coordinator, and even our basic package includes fresh flowers and award-winning photos.\n\nBasic\n\n$299\n\nTraditional\n\n$495\n\nRomantic\n\n$650\n\nWe've got plenty more packages to check out.\nFind more packages\nWe've got plenty more packages to check out.\nFind more packages\nAffordable All-Inclusive\nWedding Packages\n\nLooking for the complete Las Vegas wedding package? Chapel of the Flowers now offers ceremony and reception packages perfect for any wedding budget. Toast to love, enjoy your meal, and celebrate at one of our elegant reception venues.\n\nSee Our Packages\nStress-free Vegas Wedding Planning\n\nCouples are consistently impressed with our world-class customer service and ability to plan the entire wedding ceremony. We can orchestrate your flowers, reception, tuxedo & gown rentals, and provide award-winning photography, and everything else you need to create a flawless Las Vegas wedding experience.\n\nEXPLORE OUR SERVICES\nPhotos\nFlowers\nCeremony\nAttire\nReception\nHotel\nVideo\nSee All\nAward-Winning\nWedding Photography\n\nChapel of the Flowers offers award-winning wedding photography to make sure you capture every special moment of your big day on the world-famous Las Vegas Strip! Our photography packages offer several options that are sure to fit any budget.\n\nFind Out More\n;\nTRENDING CHAPELS\nThe Glass Gardens Las Vegas\nLa Capella Wedding Chapel\nValley of Fire Weddings\nGazebo Wedding Las Vegas\nGrand Canyon Chapels\nTRENDING PACKAGES\nValley of Fire Wedding Package\nVegas Strip Basic Wedding Package\nCherish Wedding Package\nBella Eleganza Wedding Package\nViva Elvis Vegas Wedding Package\nPRODUCTS\nChapels\nPackages\nReceptions\nWedding Enhancements\nWedding Specials\nHotels\nCHAPEL OF THE FLOWERS\nView a Ceremony\nContact Us\nAbout Us\nReviews\nSite Map\nNEED TO KNOW\nWhat Sets Us Apart\nWedding Blog\nTestimonials\nFAQs\nMarriage Licensing\nContracts\nMEDIA AND PARTNERS\nChapel Videos\nLocations and Tour\nPartners\nScholarship\nDIGITAL BROCHURES\nEnglish\nFrançais\nDeutsch\nItaliano\n國語\nPortuguês\nРусский\nEspañol\nTRENDING PACKAGES\nValley of Fire Wedding Package\nVegas Strip Basic Wedding Package\nCherish Wedding Package\nBella Eleganza Wedding Package\nViva Elvis Vegas Wedding Package\nLocal (702) 735-4331\n|\n\n\nToll Free (800) 843-2410\n|\n\n\nmarryme@littlechapel.com\n|\n\n\n1717 Las Vegas Blvd S, Las Vegas NV 89104\n©2024 Chapel of the Flowers\n|\n\n\nPrivacy Policy\n|\n\n\nTerms & Conditions"
